# ── Autodesk Fusion 360 ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Parametric source of record lives in Fusion Team cloud versioning.
# Git holds the neutral geometry record (STEP) and documentation only.
# Policy reference: SEDEP-PMP-002 §3.1
