# ── AIEF CAD bridge ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The file queue is the transport, not the record. Every command and every
# observation is copied verbatim into cad/runs/<run>/run.json, which IS
# tracked - so the audit trail survives without committing the scratch that
# carried it. `state/` holds the add-in heartbeat and idempotency markers,
# which are machine-local by definition.
cad/bridge/queue/
cad/bridge/obs/
cad/bridge/state/

# ── Explicitly TRACKED (negations) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Released neutral geometry and drawings are part of the record.
!cad/exports/step/*.step
!cad/exports/step/*.stp
!drawings/**/*.pdf
!releases/**
